      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "喂，等了很久了嗎？",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "沒有很久，三個小時罷了。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "芷君坐下。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "結果怎樣？",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你猜對了，依然是那樣那樣。",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "這是今年第四次。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "似乎，我也是時候忘了他吧？",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "講就容易。要是辦得到，你不會在一個月內跟我喝四杯特濃。",
      "expr": "04-cold"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "他變了。整個人變得放蕩不羈，說話爽朗豪邁。不像從前，會花小心思哄人。",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "芷君看著還沒動過的杯子。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "都是小明不好，害人家浸泡在咖啡的泡沫中。",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "你根本一口也還沒喝。別撒賴了。",
      "expr": "05-fire"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "風把咖啡吹涼。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "對了，你的情況如何？結果出來了嗎？",
      "expr": "04-puff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "出來了。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "怎樣？",
      "expr": "01-laugh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "面試也通過了。今年暑假便可以飛到美國。",
      "expr": "01-shrug"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "嘩，棒極了。恭喜啊。",
      "expr": "02-hips"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "那個笑是牽強的。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "乾杯。",
      "expr": "02-blush"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "乾杯。",
      "expr": "03-glare"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "電話響了。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "jump",
      "to": "ch12-call"
    }
  ]
}
